  "system": {
    "localizationKey": "REDSTEEL.Items.Mornerai.name",
    "description": "<p><strong>Table ruling (not automated):</strong></p><ul><li>Dark spell power +2.</li><li>+3% to Melee or Ranged (pick one).</li><li>Dark hatred: activated as a free action at any time during combat or right before it begins. Lasts until the end of combat or until Health drops to 1 or less. Each round it is active: gain 1 Corruption, lose 3 Health, and all healing received is halved. It cannot reduce Health below 1. In return: +5% to hit (Melee and Ranged), +10% Channeling, spell power +2, and +2d4 damage in Melee and Ranged.</li></ul>",
